**Merge manifest.** It is read by `/auto-merge` and the `pr-manifest` check, so keep the fence and every key. Replace each `<…>`: CI fails while one is left.

```yaml merge-manifest
kind: <task|chore|release|hotfix>
tasks: [<TASK-NNN>]          # the ledger ids this PR carries; [] for none
phase: <phase id|none>       # the roadmap phase this work belongs to
release: <vX.Y.Z|none>       # the release it is targeted at (tasks/RELEASES.md)
merge: manual                # auto = /auto-merge may merge it (it also needs the auto-merge label)
method: squash               # squash | merge | rebase
after: []                    # PRs that must merge first, e.g. [#41]
on_merge: hold               # hold | deploy:<env> | release:<version>
migrations: none             # or: what runs, and whether it reverses
rollback: revert             # or: the steps that undo it once it is in
```

